# Build-time public values. Every one of these ships in the bundle; nothing
# secret belongs here. A build that defines none of them is a working console
# with the facility each one turns on left dormant.

# The PostHog project key. Absent, the client initialises nothing and loads
# nothing. Events reach PostHog through this origin's own /ingest proxy, so
# no host is configured here.
PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
